{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21078","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21078/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21078/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21078/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/21078","id":282944628,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyODI5NDQ2Mjg=","number":21078,"title":"Xliff parser only supports x tags in target","user":{"login":"nikklassen","id":3314933,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTQ5MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3314933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen","html_url":"https://github.com/nikklassen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikklassen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":251048427,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTEwNDg0Mjc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20i18n","name":"area: i18n","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues related to localization and internationalization"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2017-12-18T16:42:41Z","updated_at":"2019-09-13T04:51:34Z","closed_at":"2018-01-18T01:05:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\nPLEASE HELP US PROCESS GITHUB ISSUES FASTER BY PROVIDING THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION.\r\n\r\nISSUES MISSING IMPORTANT INFORMATION MAY BE CLOSED WITHOUT INVESTIGATION.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## I'm submitting a...\r\n<!-- Check one of the following options with \"x\" -->\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[ ] Regression (a behavior that used to work and stopped working in a new release)\r\n[ ] Bug report  <!-- Please search GitHub for a similar issue or PR before submitting -->\r\n[x] Feature request\r\n[ ] Documentation issue or request\r\n[ ] Support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\n<!-- Describe how the issue manifests. -->\r\nWhen attempting to use a translated xliff file containing segmentation tags I get the error message\r\n`Unexpected tag (\"[ERROR ->]<mrk mtype=\"seg\" mid=\"1\">OK</mrk>\"): i18n@0:0`\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\n<!-- Describe what the desired behavior would be. -->\r\nThe inner xml of these tags should be returned. \r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\n<!--\r\nFor bug reports please provide the *STEPS TO REPRODUCE* and if possible a *MINIMAL DEMO* of the problem via\r\nhttps://plnkr.co or similar (you can use this template as a starting point: http://plnkr.co/edit/tpl:AvJOMERrnz94ekVua0u5).\r\n-->\r\nAn example of translation file containing this kind of tag is\r\n```xml\r\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\r\n<xliff version=\"1.2\" xmlns=\"urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2\">\r\n    <file source-language=\"en\" datatype=\"plaintext\" original=\"ng2.template\">\r\n        <body>\r\n            <trans-unit id=\"app.action.ok\" datatype=\"html\">\r\n                <source>OK</source>\r\n                <seg-source><mrk mtype=\"seg\" mid=\"1\">OK</mrk></seg-source>\r\n                <target><mrk mtype=\"seg\" mid=\"1\">OK</mrk></target>\r\n                <context-group purpose=\"location\">\r\n                    <context context-type=\"sourcefile\">app/home/app.component.ts</context>\r\n                    <context context-type=\"linenumber\">9</context>\r\n                </context-group>\r\n            </trans-unit>\r\n        </body>\r\n    </file>\r\n</xliff>\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case. -->\r\nThis is the format we got back from our translators. It appears they are using segmentation, described in the xliff spec [here](http://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/xliff-core.html#Struct_Segmentation). The spec also says that a `<target>` can contain\r\n> Zero, one or more of the following elements: &lt;g&gt;, &lt;x/&gt;, &lt;bx/&gt;, &lt;ex/&gt;, &lt;bpt&gt; , &lt;ept&gt;, &lt;ph&gt;, &lt;it&gt; , &lt;mrk&gt;, in any order.\r\n\r\nIt would be beneficial if Angular's xliff parser supported a larger subset of xliff so we don't have to strip these tags from our translated files.\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\n    _                      _                 ____ _     ___\r\n   / \\   _ __   __ _ _   _| | __ _ _ __     / ___| |   |_ _|\r\n  / △ \\ | '_ \\ / _` | | | | |/ _` | '__|   | |   | |    | |\r\n / ___ \\| | | | (_| | |_| | | (_| | |      | |___| |___ | |\r\n/_/   \\_\\_| |_|\\__, |\\__,_|_|\\__,_|_|       \\____|_____|___|\r\n               |___/\r\n\r\nAngular CLI: 1.5.4\r\nNode: 8.9.0\r\nOS: darwin x64\r\nAngular: 5.0.0\r\n... animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, forms\r\n... http, language-service, platform-browser\r\n... platform-browser-dynamic, router\r\n\r\n@angular/cli: 1.5.4\r\n@angular-devkit/build-optimizer: 0.0.32\r\n@angular-devkit/core: 0.0.20\r\n@angular-devkit/schematics: 0.0.35\r\n@ngtools/json-schema: 1.1.0\r\n@ngtools/webpack: 1.8.4\r\n@schematics/angular: 0.1.0\r\ntypescript: 2.4.2\r\nwebpack: 3.8.1\r\n</code></pre>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"chuckjaz","id":372013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjAxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz","html_url":"https://github.com/chuckjaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21078/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21078/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}